--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/3477.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed a bug where the connection's ``ssl_context`` verification settings would override those of a proxy's ``proxy_ssl_context``, making it impossible to verify the proxy connection while skipping verification of the proxied connection.
